/1465" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS-Brew&lt;/a&gt; 等。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/oZeallRydUvoZG5BHH4wCwMoMxdZFGcRRA3eHJnlycV2kkRbowqL8dIC798WsCfwp42ID-dfgqGAod8S3XI7qcTlSEM87i9iMFS09zrJkqfP3HnnLPL8QdBluid1lBf41_uogGK99zrm-CihfyxguyEASlhgUAfW-7l__MS8YM1I1bjIfgXlKcN1FRIY5xfp03lOc3xWikH9i5KG_yxT6ztnkh3pjTJR5CkIyVamsm-Eu-2iLqd2LksFW2JoS4LGz6ir5jsZNGaavZr-8i0PBzAWiztI66TEaDGmcimp9dW-W9bE3AP8PO82wAVQsWKXWhL3eczMvV4MI81FocA2Kw.jpg" width="800" height="282" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1525</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1525</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 10:01:37 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 MrRSS: 一个 AI 加持下的多平台 #开源 RSS 阅读器</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MrRSS: 一个 AI 加持下的多平台 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1524?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#开源&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; RSS 阅读器&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢&lt;a href="https://t.me/allaboutrss/23497" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;群友投稿&lt;/a&gt;，介绍了一款目前在 GitHub 上 1K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt; 的 RSS 阅读器软件：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网：&lt;a href="https://mrrss.ch3nyang.top/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://mrrss.ch3nyang.top/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repo：&lt;a href="https://github.com/WCY-dt/MrRSS" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/WCY-dt/MrRSS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;「小众软件」的介绍：&lt;a href="https://www.appinn.com/mrrss/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.appinn.com/mrrss/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/gCyskg3JBKhOc91rzaxJ-1X0bP_RtRRad7LyQmj_kZSDmGj5VWQe71D5WYC253CrI1lcB0bBz67bV1LGiW42NFZO09tR-38RGq8nR1gkvAibno8j36PAcn-AHij4c6iDYNlmx5awkT8_mlIrxB5DD2LUoauOICJOmX8e5HmpgXmDlcDBYCcia_jT9MPNgq2jEAy3z8OgAAqO_sw53ZK2HgYZlBSUiEqWb1VyMTu_9T4DMbxSXG6g9_PetVHdAvOpTFV12_-tU_um-a7Fod2IG2mvycT7zy0tQc8ZUMFPXRA2bWmK